Proprietary Lenovo device firmware for the Legion Y700 Gen2 (TB320FC, SM8475).

These are the stock firmware blobs from that exact model's Android firmware,
copied verbatim; nothing here is built from source in this repository. They are
Lenovo/Qualcomm/Cirrus/Novatek property and are redistributed here only so that
mainline drivers on the same hardware can load them.

in this directory (asked for by DT, see the kernel board file):
  adsp.mdt, adsp.b00..b23, adsp.b25   ADSP (audio DSP) image. The stock set has
                                      no b24 segment; the ADSP loads fine
                                      without it. remoteproc_adsp firmware-name.
  a730_zap.mdt, a730_zap.b00..b02     Adreno A730 zap shader, the secure
                                      microcode for the GPU power domain.
                                      gpu_zap_shader firmware-name.
in ../../ (the Adreno A730 on this SoC revision needs the stock pair, the
linux-firmware files of the same names are for other Adreno SKUs):
  a730_sqe.fw                         GMU ringbuffer front-end
  gmu_gen70000.bin                    GMU microcode
in ../../../cirrus/ and again in the firmware root (the CS35L45 driver looks in
both places):
  spk1-cs35l45-dsp1-spk-prot.bin/.wmfw, spk2-...   amplifier protection
                                      firmware and tuning; the two speakers use
                                      the same wmfw, which the stock image
                                      carries as a symlink from spk2 to spk1.
in ../../../ (requested by name from novatek,nvt36xxx-ts-spi):
  novatek_ts_fw.bin                   NVT36xxx SPI touch controller firmware